      <h1 id="virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="group scroll-mt-20">Connect to a virtual machine console<a href="#virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p class="_abstract">By using VNC, serial, or desktop viewer consoles, you can access the console of your virtual machine for troubleshooting when the VM does not have network connectivity.</p>
