      <h2 id="virt-vnc-console-considerations_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="group scroll-mt-20">Considerations for accessing the VNC console<a href="#virt-vnc-console-considerations_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can connect to the VNC console of a VM by using the OpenShift Container Platform web console or the <code>virtctl</code> command-line tool.</p>
