      <h2 id="virt-connecting-vnc-console-virtctl_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="group scroll-mt-20">Connect to the VNC console by using virtctl<a href="#virt-connecting-vnc-console-virtctl_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can use the <code>virtctl</code> command-line tool to connect to the VNC console of a running virtual machine.</p>
