      <h2 id="virt-grant-token-generation-permission-VNC_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="group scroll-mt-20">Grant token generation permission for the VNC console by using the cluster role<a href="#virt-grant-token-generation-permission-VNC_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
