      <h2 id="virt-generate-temporary-token-VNC_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="group scroll-mt-20">Generate a temporary token for the VNC console<a href="#virt-generate-temporary-token-VNC_virt-accessing-vm-consoles" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
